{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3001_p", "source_sha256": "9dba1748c5a767da9378ccfcf0e30f21ea455f475042a3a3bb21ac372805d2cd", "ja": "もうすぐ、時間だな。準備はいいか、環？", "zh": "开始时间快到了，准备好了吗，环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3002_040tam", "source_sha256": "850525b8020c698715ad4bd7f063cb25f28a339fde3a720068780aafa449717f", "ja": "うんっ！　見ててね、おやぶんっ！　\nたまき、今日のために、いーっぱい練習したもんね♪", "zh": "嗯！要好好看着喔，老大！\n环为了今天，可是练习了好久好久呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c776c9b4ce6b45bfc142452ba919a835eba08781ae3943b80eeb41050356f0ec", "ja": "超はやいスピードで、ぱぱぱぱーって、\nサイン書きまくるぞ～っ！　くふふ……♪", "zh": "今天要用超快的速度，唰唰唰唰～地\n签名签到底喔～！呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3004_p", "source_sha256": "224d6fde672f3c8b0bf50090043ba5926a23b764f119aa196ba845caedc28131", "ja": "おいおい、環……。サインは、早く書くことが\n大事なんじゃないぞ？", "zh": "喂喂，环……签名时，\n最重要的可不是速度喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3005_040tam", "source_sha256": "58a9195e7ed97cf78fcf6043a6409ed9ea0eeca77a573bea368378cb3570cd6a", "ja": "えぇっ？　じゃあ、なにが大事なの？", "zh": "咦咦？那最重要的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3006", "source_sha256": "a49e33d95b1b9feb48b7535ed3962aa91107a21d021aff5d097c27b51eec4c59", "ja": "心を込めて書く", "zh": "用心签名", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3007", "source_sha256": "4aa28b051634a8a9e89b8a95f3f8a149091d798431dcdb9ea86ed33e62ba154f", "ja": "力を込めて書く", "zh": "用力签名", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3200_p", "source_sha256": "266674550891b297f88f1d3794abea7a034783724514d9eeabffe90b17aebe02", "ja": "サインは、心を込めて、\n丁寧に書くのが一番、大切だと思うぞ。", "zh": "我认为签名时最重要的是\n要用心、仔细地签。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3201_040tam", "source_sha256": "07f234f43f236b79352616e4defb33c4117a5fb48248190daf59d4745a2505f3", "ja": "そっか……わかった！　たまき、みんなに、\nありがとーって気持ちをこめて、サイン書くね！", "zh": "这样啊……知道了！\n环会怀着感谢大家的心情签名喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3202_p", "source_sha256": "85052329155f20c2f2fd2ccbba8dead294c35e3b1c3fa103cf9a4e80a3e963dd", "ja": "（環の気持ちがファンの人達にも伝わって、\nサイン会は大盛況で幕を閉じた。よかった！）", "zh": "（粉丝们感受到了环的心意，\n签名会在一片盛况中落幕，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3300_p", "source_sha256": "266674550891b297f88f1d3794abea7a034783724514d9eeabffe90b17aebe02", "ja": "サインは、心を込めて、\n丁寧に書くのが一番、大切だと思うぞ。", "zh": "我认为签名时最重要的是\n要用心、仔细地签。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3301_040tam", "source_sha256": "bcefa279489dd6a1e67545850ddfdadf7348de404cc10573d6c449280fe97233", "ja": "うう、わかった……。けど、たまき、\nはやいサインしか練習してないよ……？", "zh": "呜呜，知道了……但是，\n环只有练习快速签名耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3302_040tam", "source_sha256": "ed4d7e5dc3087b4ff8eff9f466d2cb423ce0a8abd21f400fdcae5f5877d07f40", "ja": "ていねいに書くと、時間かかっちゃうけど、\nそれでもいい？　おやぶん……。", "zh": "要是仔细签的话会花很多时间，\n这样没关系吗？老大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3500_p", "source_sha256": "2d005a616a73542e2193005faadecde59348bfe02ebdb45661bf22ffae9aac4d", "ja": "環らしく、力いっぱい元気を込めて\n書くのがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "就用环的风格，\n活力满满地用力签名吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3501_040tam", "source_sha256": "b7e1ea72596a98ac869fe545542bba78f2886751a4944581b7467971b36a3e56", "ja": "そっか……じゃあ、そうするっ！　\nみんな、よろこんでくれるかな～？", "zh": "这样啊……那就这么办！\n大家会不会很开心呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3502_p", "source_sha256": "1b7f023ff61b6f01370c378460a6f59e95728f862dff0259e1a2fd75a310619d", "ja": "（力強い環のサインを、ファンは喜んでくれた\nようだ。いいサイン会になったな！）", "zh": "（粉丝拿到环充满力道的签名，似乎都很开心，\n这场签名会办得非常成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3600_p", "source_sha256": "2d005a616a73542e2193005faadecde59348bfe02ebdb45661bf22ffae9aac4d", "ja": "環らしく、力いっぱい元気を込めて\n書くのがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "就用环的风格，\n活力满满地用力签名吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3601_040tam", "source_sha256": "3ff57948bed9bd739fefcdbb309ee6e5f03ec31427f2d172a10c3135abb708f4", "ja": "わかった！　たまき、思いっきりサイン書くね！\nくふふっ、楽しみだぞ～♪", "zh": "知道了！环会尽力签名的喔！\n呵呵，好期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_3602_040tam", "source_sha256": "23e126625f0fe300bf15c7e7534a863d8d489620825134d1b714c64dc40e434e", "ja": "うう……ぜんぶ、色紙からはみでちゃった……。\nこれでよかったのかな、おやぶん……？", "zh": "呜呜……全都签出签名板外了……\n这样没关系吗，老大……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
